"statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"En chinois simplifié, 只 réunit deux caractères : 只, une particule de fin de phrase employée ensuite pour « seulement », et 隻, un oiseau tenu dans la main, devenu classificateur. Pour s'en souvenir : sous la bouche 口, les deux traits de 八 évoquent le souffle qui s'en échappe. Lu zhī, c'est le classificateur des animaux et des objets qui vont par paire ; lu zhǐ, il signifie « seulement », comme dans 只有.","en":"In simplified Chinese, 只 merges two characters: 只, a sentence-final particle later used for “only”, and 隻, a bird held in the hand, which became a measure word. To remember it: under the mouth 口, the two strokes of 八 suggest breath escaping from it. Read zhī, it is the measure word for animals and for one of a pair; read zhǐ, it means “only”, as in 只有.","roles":{"口":"sens","八":"forme"}}},"址":{"c":"址","pinyin":"zhǐ","lectures":["zhǐ"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","止"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0185","L4-0747","L7-4905","L7-5469"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"emplacement, site","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"emplacement, site ; adresse"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"指":{"c":"指","pinyin":"zhǐ","lectures":["zhǐ","zhī","zhí"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","匕","日"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0672","L3-0916","L3-0917","L3-0918","L4-0954","L5-1013","L5-1014","L5-1015","L5-1016","L6-1076","L6-1077","L6-1078","L6-1079","L7-2136","L7-5372","L7-5373","L7-5374","L7-5375","L7-5376","L7-5377","L7-5378","L7-5379","L7-5380"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"montrer du doigt ; désigner ; doigt","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"montrer du doigt, indiquer"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"désigner, vouloir dire"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"doigt"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他指着地图给我看。","pinyin":"Tā zhǐ zhe dìtú gěi wǒ kàn.","fr":"Il me montrait la carte du doigt.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你说的是指谁？","pinyin":"Nǐ shuō de shì zhǐ shéi?","fr":"De qui parles-tu ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"旨":{"c":"旨","pinyin":"zhǐ","lectures":["zhǐ"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["匕","日"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-5371","L7-5581"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"but, intention ; décret","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"but, intention, sens"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"décret impérial"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"止":{"c":"止","pinyin":"zhǐ","lectures":["zhǐ"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L3-0187","L3-0718","L4-0412","L4-0995","L5-0067","L5-0783","L5-1028","L6-0448","L6-1072","L7-2237","L7-2281","L7-3223","L7-5368","L7-5369","L7-5370","L7-5388","L7-5415"],"chemin":{"hsk":111,"lire":107},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"arrêter, cesser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"arrêter, cesser, s'arrêter"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他笑个不止。","pinyin":"Tā xiào ge bù zhǐ.","fr":"Il n'en finissait pas de rire.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 止 dessine un pied, ou plutôt son empreinte, la plante et quelques orteils. Le Shuowen jiezi y voit d'abord la base d'une plante qui sort de terre, et ajoute qu'il sert à écrire le pied. Du pied qui se pose vient le sens d'« arrêter », et le pied se retrouve dans 走 ou 些.","en":"On oracle bones, 止 draws a foot, or rather its print, the sole and a few toes. The Shuowen jiezi first sees in it the base of a plant coming out of the ground, and adds that it is used to write “foot”. From the foot set down comes the meaning “to stop”, and the foot turns up again in 走 or 些.","roles":{}}},"纸":{"c":"纸","pinyin":"zhǐ","lectures":["zhǐ"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["纟","氏"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0015","L2-0733","L7-4177","L7-5213"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"papier","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"papier ; feuil