,"fr":"Je travaille du lundi au vendredi.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 至 dessine une flèche qui vient se planter dans le sol, la pointe sur une ligne. Le Shuowen jiezi y voit plutôt un oiseau qui descend du ciel et se pose à terre. Du sens d'« arriver » vient celui de « jusqu'à », et 至 donne son sens à 到, arriver, où 刀 donne le son.","en":"On oracle bones, 至 draws an arrow landing in the ground, its point on a line. The Shuowen jiezi sees a bird flying down from the sky to the ground instead. From “to arrive” comes “up to”, and 至 gives its meaning to 到, to arrive, where 刀 gives the sound.","roles":{}}},"致":{"c":"致","pinyin":"zhì","lectures":["zhì"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["至","𠂉","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0167","L4-0784","L4-0869","L5-0170","L6-0169","L7-0207","L7-0221","L7-2213","L7-4651","L7-4914","L7-5395","L7-5396","L7-5397","L7-5398","L7-5399","L7-5400","L7-5401"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"adresser, exprimer ; causer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"adresser, exprimer : salut, remerciements"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"causer, entraîner"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他向大家致谢。","pinyin":"Tā xiàng dàjiā zhìxiè.","fr":"Il a remercié tout le monde.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"质":{"c":"质","pinyin":"zhì","lectures":["zhì"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["厂","十","贝"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L4-0558","L4-0825","L4-0956","L5-0806","L6-0035","L6-0773","L6-0988","L7-0106","L7-0189","L7-0753","L7-0838","L7-2639","L7-3221","L7-3449","L7-3715","L7-4047","L7-4066","L7-5389","L7-5390","L7-5391","L7-5392"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nature, qualité ; matière","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"nature, qualité ; matière"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"中":{"c":"中","pinyin":"zhōng","lectures":["zhōng","zhòng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":